              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wokoni wabaa wose wa wakohani na wandu, weresighieghe putu kukaia waloli; wikanugha maza rose rizamie ra mbari ra wandu, nawo wikailusha Hekalu iyo BWANA oreieleshereghe aho Jerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "BWANA, uo Mlungu wa weke ndee, orekoghe ukiwidumia wadumwa wake sena na sena, angu orekoghe na wughoma kwa wandu wake, na Andu kwake Kokaia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela wikakaia wikiwiseka wadumwa wa Mlungu kwa lumenyo, wikamenya malagho ghake na walodi wake; hata BWANA ukajokwa ni machu nandighi aighu ya wandu wake, na wutesia ghungi ghukasoweka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa huwo BWANA ukawiredia mzuri wa Babuloni, ukawibwagha wandu wawo wa irika andenyi ya Hekalu; nao nderekoghe na wughoma ghungi kwa mdawana, angu mwai; mghosi, angu mkeku; Mlungu ukamneka kuwisima wose.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
