        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwaka ghwa imbiri ghwa Kuro mzuri wa Pashia, eri ilagho ja BWANA jipate kukatia kwaro, ijo jereghoreloghe ni Mlodi Jeremia, BWANA ukamngira Kuro mzuri wa Pashia ngolo eeresha malagho andenyi ya wuzuri ghwake ghose na kughiandika wori, ukighamba, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ini mzuri wa Pashia naghamba kukaia, BWANA uo Mlungu wa mlungunyi waninekie mawuzuri ghose gha ndoenyi, nao wanilaghirie nimuaghie Hekalu Jerusalemu andenyi ya isanga ja Juda. Mndungi uo ose wa wandu wake uko aghadi konyu ndejoke aho, na BWANA Mlungu wake ndekaie andwamweri nao.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.23"
            ]
          }
        },
